$ mp fetch --help
Fetch emails from IMAP server

Usage: mp fetch [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --from <FROM>            Filter by sender address
      --to <TO>                Filter by recipient address
      --cc <CC>                Filter by CC address
      --subject <SUBJECT>      Subject contains
      --body <BODY>            Body contains
      --since <SINCE>          Emails since date (YYYY-MM-DD)
      --before <BEFORE>        Emails before date (YYYY-MM-DD)
  -n, --limit <LIMIT>          Max results (default: 10) [default: 10]
      --full                   Show full body instead of preview
      --mailbox <MAILBOX>      Mailbox name (default: INBOX) [default: INBOX]
  -s, --signature <SIGNATURE>  Signature to use (overrides config default)
      --no-signature           Skip signature entirely
  -A, --account <ACCOUNT>      Account to use (default: first in config)
  -h, --help                   Print help

