$ mp calendar --help
Calendar / iMIP invite operations

Usage: mp calendar [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  rebuild  Reconcile locally-stored invites against attendee REPLY emails, recomputing `event.attendees[].status` from the whole mailstore. Idempotent and safe to re-run; rebuilds derived state from IMAP alone
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -s, --signature <SIGNATURE>  Signature to use (overrides config default)
      --no-signature           Skip signature entirely
  -A, --account <ACCOUNT>      Account to use (default: first in config)
  -h, --help                   Print help

